<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5110" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμείλ-ῐχος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>implacable, relentless,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀΐδης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					9.158
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἦτορ</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				572
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sol.
					32
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρατός</span> (of rain), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κότος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				6.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				8.8
			</span></i>:—a form <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμειλίχιος</span></b>  occurs in Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ίως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Epigr.Gr.</u>
					313
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Smyrna</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of things, <i>unmitigated,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόνοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ch.</u>
					623
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμείλιχα σάρκες ἔχουσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					14.2461
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Massilia</span>).</div>
